{"ἐδαφίζω":{"l":"ἐδαφίζω","id":"G1474","x":"edaphízō","g":"I dash to the ground","gs":"dodson","long":"I dash to the ground, level with the ground.","sd":"to raze","kj":"lay even with the ground","der":"from G1475 (ἔδαφος);","as":"<div><b>ἐδαφίζω</b> (&lt; <span class=\"gr\">ἔδαφος</span>) </div><div><span class=\"lxx\">[in LXX chiefly for <a class=\"he-inline\" data-he=\"7376\">רטשׁ</a> pu. ;]</span></div><div><div><span class=\"n\">1.</span><b>to beat level like a threshing floor</b> (Theophr.). </div><div><span class=\"n\">2.</span><b>to dash to the ground</b> (Field, <i>Notes</i>, 74): <a data-ref=\"Luke.19.44\">Lk 19:44</a> (cf. <a>Ps 136 (137):9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hos.14.1\">Ho 14:1</a>).†</div></div>","heb":[[7376,"רטשׁ"]],"n":1,"lxxN":6},"ἔδαφος":{"l":"ἔδαφος","id":"G1475","x":"édaphos","g":"the base, ground","gs":"dodson","long":"the base, ground, bottom.","sd":"a basis (bottom), i.e. the soil","kj":"ground","der":"from the base of G1476 (ἑδραῖος);","as":"<div><b>ἔδαφος</b>, <span class=\"gr\">-εος (-ους), τό</span>, </div><div><span class=\"lxx\">[in LXX for <a class=\"he-inline\" data-he=\"6083\">עָפָר</a>, <a class=\"he-inline\" data-he=\"7172\">קַרְקע</a>, etc. ;]</span></div><div><b>bottom, pavement, ground</b>: <a data-ref=\"Acts.22.7\">Ac 22:7</a>.†</div>","heb":[[6083,"עָפָר"],[7172,"קַרְקע"]],"n":1,"lxxN":23},"ἑδραῖος":{"l":"ἑδραῖος","id":"G1476","x":"hedraîos","g":"firm, steadfast","gs":"dodson","long":"sitting, seated; steadfast, firm.","sd":"sedentary, i.e. (by implication) immovable","kj":"settled, stedfast","der":"from a derivative of (to sit);","as":"<div>**<b>ἑδραῖος</b>, <span class=\"gr\">-ον</span> (&lt; <span class=\"gr\">ἕδρα</span>, <i>a seat</i>), [in Sm.: <a>Ps 32 (33):14</a>, al. ;] </div><div><div><span class=\"n\">1.</span><b>sitting, seated</b>. </div><div><span class=\"n\">2.</span><b>steadfast, firm</b>; metaph., of moral fixity: <a data-ref=\"1Cor.7.37\">I Co 7:37</a><a data-ref=\"1Cor.15.58\">15:58</a>, <a data-ref=\"Col.1.23